# Scratch output of a local run. Anchored with a leading slash so that these
# patterns match ONLY at the repository root: an unanchored `junit.xml` would
# also exclude fixtures/planted/junit.xml and fixtures/p024_bdot/junit.xml,
# which are REQUIRED committed deliverables. That exact defect shipped in
# P060 of this portfolio and is why the slashes are here.
/junit.xml
/report.json
/report.md
/structure.mmd
/structure.png
